2,149.5 312,111"/><circle cx="58" cy="111" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="58" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">Jan</text><circle cx="108.8" cy="168.75" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="108.8" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">Feb</text><circle cx="159.6" cy="111" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="159.6" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">Mar</text><circle cx="210.4" cy="111" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="210.4" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">Apr</text><circle cx="261.2" cy="149.5" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="261.2" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">May</text><circle cx="312" cy="111" r="4" fill="#059669"/><text x="312" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11">Jun</text></svg>','["Jan–Feb","Apr–May","Feb–Mar","Mar–Apr"]',2,'The largest rise is 15°C, from Feb to Mar.',1,0);
